,\"latitude\":\"51.5501374\",\"longitude\":\"0.0475166\",\"address\":\"501 High St N, London E12 6TH, UK\",\"icon\":null,\"image\":null,\"published\":1,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-18T09:41:35.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-08-19T07:05:03.000000Z\",\"user_id\":50039,\"city\":{\"id\":14885,\"name\":{\"ar\":\"لندن\",\"en\":\"London\"},\"slug\":\"london\",\"timezone\":null,\"latitude\":\"51.5072° N\",\"longitude\":\"0.1276° W\",\"published\":1,\"is_capital\":0,\"country_id\":239,\"currency_code\":\"GBP\",\"created_at\":\"2025-05-18T06:37:06.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-06T08:46:12.000000Z\",\"unlisted\":0,\"country\":{\"id\":239,\"name\":{\"ar\":\"المملكة المتحدة\",\"en\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"date_format\":\"D, d M Y H:i\",\"iso\":\"GB\",\"currency_code\":\"GBP\",\"latitude\":\"55.3780510\",\"longitude\":\"-3.4359730\",\"published\":1,\"created_at\":\"2025-05-18T06:36:44.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-06T08:46:12.000000Z\",\"vat\":0,\"continent\":\"europe\"}},\"seated_venue\":{\"id\":1001304,\"place_id\":878,\"key\":\"33731f83-5282-81cc-b08f-72e96f931c93\",\"name\":\"The Royal Regency - London\",\"status\":\"PUBLISHED\",\"tags\":null,\"archived\":0,\"publishedVersionThumbnailUrl\":\"https://cdn-thumbnails.seatsio.net/region/eu/workspaceKey/84602b85-4af4-4edf-b274-8482d06cdf28/charts/33731f83-5282-81cc-b08f-72e96f931c93/version/published/thumbnail/367\",\"draftVersionThumbnailUrl\":null,\"created_at\":\"2026-08-19T07:04:44.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-11-03T13:14:30.000000Z\"}},\"from_date_only\":\"2026-11-14\",\"to_date_only\":\"2026-11-14\",\"from_time_only\":\"07:00 PM\",\"to_time_only\":\"11:00 PM\",\"country_id\":239},{\"id\":4997,\"name\":{\"ar\":\"النادي - حفلة الافتتاح\",\"en\":\"El Naadi Launch Party\"},\"content\":{\"ar\":\"<p class=\\\"ql-direction-rtl\\\"><strong>النادي بيرجّع لكم دفا حفلات العيلة اللي كبرنا عليها، للي واحشهم الجو ده، وللي لسه ما عاشوهوش.</strong></p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p class=\\\"ql-direction-rtl\\\">زيتون مشكّل، ديبس، عيش بلدي (أيوه، عيش بلدي بجد!!)، ورق عنب محشي، طعمية ,باذنجان مخلل، ومعمول بالتمر.</p><p class=\\\"ql-direction-rtl\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p class=\\\"ql-direction-rtl\\\">اللي هتاخدوه مع تذكرتكم:</p><p class=\\\"ql-direction-rtl\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p class=\\\"ql-direction-rtl\\\"><strong>-مزّة:</strong> متعملة بحب، من وصفات العيلة ومكوّنات جاية من منطقة SWANA.</p><p class=\\\"ql-direction-rtl\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p class=\\\"ql-direction-rtl\\\"><strong>-المشروبات مفتوحة طول الليل (لحد ما الكمية تخلص)، بكحول وبدون كحول:</strong> استنوا نبيذ لبناني، ومشروبات شعير من غير كحول من مصر، وحاجات تانية كمان.</p><p class=\\\"ql-direction-rtl\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p class=\\\"ql-direction-rtl\\\">موسيقى لايف من اتنين فنانين تحفة، بالتعاون مع <a href=\\\"https://www.instagram.com/swanarecords/?hl=en-gb\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">SWANA Records</a>. متحمسين قوي إن معانا <a href=\\\"https://www.instagram.com/vincentj_official/\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">Vincent J</a> , الفنان اللبناني اللي ساكن في لندن، والفنانة المصرية <a href=\\\"https://www.instagram.com/layalmusic/?hl=en\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">ليال</a>.</p><p class=\\\"ql-direction-rtl\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p class=\\\"ql-direction-rtl\\\">شوفونا على <a href=\\\"https://www.instagram.com/el.naadi/\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">إنستجرام</a> وتابعوا رحلة النادي معانا.</p>\",\"en\":\"<p><strong style=\\\"color: rgb(12, 16, 20);\\\">El Naadi </strong><span style=\\\"color: rgb(12, 16, 20);\\\">brings the warmth of the family parties we grew up with to those who miss it and those who haven’t experienced it.</span></p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p><span style=\\\"color: rgb(12, 16, 20);\\\">Your ticket includes:</span></p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p><strong>-Mezze:</strong> Fully vegetarian and cooked with love, using family recipes and ingredients sourced from the SWANA region. </p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\">Mixed olives, dips, Egyptian bread (yes, real 3eish baladi!!), stuffed vine leaves, ta'ameya (Egyptian falafel), pickled aubergines &amp; maamoul (date cookies).</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p><strong>-Drinks flowing all night (whilst stocks last)</strong>, both boozy and booze-free: expect Lebanese wines, Egyptian non-alcoholic malt beverages &amp; more. There will also be the opportunity to purchase beverages to take home with you at the end of the event. </p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p><strong>-Live music</strong> from two incredible acts, in collaboration with <a href=\\\"https://www.instagram.com/swanarecords/?hl=en-gb\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">SWANA records</a>. We're so excited to have London-based Lebanese artist <a href=\\\"https://www.instagram.com/vincentj_official/\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">Vincent J </a>and Egyptian artist <a href=\\\"https://www.instagram.com/layalmusic/?hl=en\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">Layal</a>. </p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p><strong style=\\\"color: rgb(12, 16, 20);\\\">El Naadi</strong><span style=\\\"color: rgb(12, 16, 20);\\\"> evenings are about joy; they’re a chance to celebrate all that our countries have to offer, in a space that feels like home and with people who feel like family. Come as you are. </span><strong style=\\\"color: rgb(12, 16, 20);\\\">We'd love to welcome you to the club.</strong></p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p><span style=\\\"color: rgb(12, 16, 20);\\\">Check us out on</span><a href=\\\"https://www.instagram.com/el.naadi/\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" style=\\\"color: rgb(12, 16, 20);\\\"> Instagram</a><span style=\\\"color: rgb(12, 16, 20);\\\"> to follow the El Naadi journey. </span></p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"><span style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\">*Please arrive at 7pm. We will start serving food shortly after, so any late arrivals may miss out. If you don’t get any ta3meeya that’s on you, so no Arabic timing please 😉 </span></p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p><span style=\\\"color: rgb(12, 16, 20);\\\">*</span>Age Restriction: 18+ and ID may be required. </p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>*Tickets are strictly limited.</p>\"},\"image\":\"images/i6b7rpODwWgkwgBb8FR0Xledjr7yxABYO2uf74v5.png\",\"images\":{\"instagram_story\":\"images/2dRM5Jz3qZPc50tYYrZjLlczBc7nmAmvrRBv86uC.jpg\",\"banner_default_image\":\"false\"},\"place\":{\"ar\":\"لا توستادورا\",\"en\":\"La Tostadora\"},\"place_id\":1010,\"city_id\":14885,\"slug\":\"el-naadi-launch-party\",\"from_date\":\"2026-11-21 17:00\",\"to_date\":\"2026-11-21 20:00\",\"ticket_types\":[{\"fees\":0,\"name\":\"RegularTicket_0\",\"color\":null,\"index\":0,\"price\":\"55\",\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"due_date\":\"2026-11-20 17:00\",\"fees_vat\":0,\"label_ar\":\"تذكرة عادية\",\"label_en\":\"Regular Ticket\",\"pay_free\":false,\"quantity\":\"40\",\"description\":null,\"hide_ticket\":false,\"pay_as_need\":false,\"max_quantity\":\"5\",\"sell_to_time\":\"05:00 PM\",\"fees_vat_rate\":0,\"sell_end_date\":\"2026-11-20\",\"ticket_active\":true,\"description_ar\":\"\",\"description_en\":\"\",\"sell_from_date\":\"2026-10-25 12:00\",\"sell_from_time\":\"12:00 PM\",\"disable_selling\":false,\"exchange_prices\":{\"AED\":269.13,\"AUD\":104.13,\"EUR\":65.27,\"GBP\":55,\"ILS\":230.27,\"JOD\":52.07,\"TRY\":3664.47,\"USD\":73.33},\"fees_before_vat\":0,\"sell_start_date\":\"2026-10-25\",\"ticket_type_name\":2,\"pay_as_need_config\":{\"max\":null,\"step\":null},\"ticket_type_name_other\":\"\"}],\"category_id\":20,\"user_id\":103452,\"published\":1,\"private\":null,\"created_at\":\"2026-10-16T15:43:20.000000Z\",\"gateway\":\"Stripe_eu\",\"seatsIo\":[],\"rsvp\":0,\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"starting_from\":{\"AED\":269.13,\"AUD\":104.13,\"EUR\":65.27,\"GBP\":55,\"ILS\":230.27,\"JOD\":52.07,\"TRY\":3664.47,\"USD\":73.33},\"cta_label\":null,\"city_name\":{\"ar\":\"لندن\",\"en\":\"London\"},\"unlisted\":0,\"extra_detail\":{\"type\":\"regular\",\"agenda\":{\"ar\":\"\",\"en\":\"\"},\"language\":\"dual\",\"is_reviewed\":\"1\",\"good_to_know\":{\"ar\":\"<p><strong>-١٨+ فقط</strong></p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>-التذاكر محدودة قوي.</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>-كل أكلنا بيتحضّر في مطبخ بيتعامل مع الـ ١٤ نوع مسبّب حساسية الرئيسيين، منها الجلوتين والمكسّرات والسمسم والألبان والبيض. نقدر نقولكم كل طبق فيه إيه من مسببات الحساسية، بس مش نقدر نضمن إن أي طبق خالي تمامًا من أي آثار. من فضلكم قولولنا لو عندكم أي حساسية وقت الحجز.</p>\",\"en\":\"<p>-Age Restriction: 18+ and ID may be required.</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>-Tickets are strictly limited.</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>-All our food is prepared in a kitchen that handles the 14 major allergens, including gluten, nuts, sesame, dairy and eggs. We can tell you which allergens are in each dish, but we can’t guarantee that any item is completely free from traces. Please let us know about any allergies when you book.</p>\"},\"hubspot_deal_id\":\"358151939803\",\"is_pending_review\":\"0\",\"is_already_selling\":\"1\",\"agree_terms_and_conditions\":true,\"already_submitted_for_review\":true,\"duplicate_good_to_know_payment\":true,\"terms_and_conditions_timestamp\":\"2026-10-27T10:43:03.712398Z\"},\"feature_private\":0,\"seo\":null,\"is_past\":0,\"label\":\"El Naadi Launch Party\",\"start_date\":\"Sat, Nov 21, 2026 7:00 PM\",\"lowest_price\":\"$73\",\"current_step\":\"success\",\"event_type\":\"regular\",\"event_step_status\":{\"event-details\":true,\"event-media\":true,\"pre-approval-tickets\":false,\"pre-approval-fields\":false,\"general-tickets\":true,\"seating-event\":false,\"seating-event-pre-approval\":false,\"rsvp\":false,\"event-preview\":true},\"venue_thumbnail_url\":null,\"checkout_link\":\"https://tzkrti.com/checkout/4997?page=1&city=london&country=gb&category=events\",\"sale_status\":\"On Sale\",\"fees\":{\"refund\":{\"type\":\"percentage\",\"value\":\"5\",\"source\":\"environment\"},\"ticket\":{\"buyer\":null,\"organizer\":{\"type\":\"percentage\",\"value\":\"7\",\"source\":\"user\"},\"shared\":false}},\"category\":{\"id\":20,\"name\":{\"ar\":\"أمسيات\",\"en\":\"Evenings\"},\"parent_id\":35,\"slug\":\"evenings\",\"label\":\"Evenings\"},\"place_obj\":{\"id\":1010,\"city_id\":14885,\"seated_venue_id\":null,\"label\":\"لا توستادورا | La Tostadora\",\"slug\":\"la-tostadora-la-tostadora\",\"name\":{\"ar\":\"لا توستادورا\",\"en\":\"La Tostadora\"},\"description\":{\"ar\":\"\",\"en\":\"\"},\"content\":{\"ar\":\"\",\"en\":\"\"},\"social_links\":null,\"latitude\":\"51.5298765\",\"longitude\":\"-0.0567771\",\"address\":\"London E2 9RF, UK\",\"icon\":null,\"image\":null,\"published\":1,\"created_at\":\"2026-10-16T14:55:26.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-10-16T14:55:26.000000Z\",\"user_id\":103452,\"city\":{\"id\":14885,\"name\":{\"ar\":\"لندن\",\"en\":\"London\"},\"slug\":\"london\",\"timezone\":null,\"latitude\":\"51.5072° N\",\"longitude\":\"0.1276° W\",\"published\":1,\"is_capital\":0,\"country_id\":239,\"currency_code\":\"GBP\",\"created_at\":\"2025-05-18T06:37:06.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-06T08:46:12.000000Z\",\"unlisted\":0,\"country\":{\"id\":239,\"name\":{\"ar\":\"المملكة المتحدة\",\"en\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"date_format\":\"D, d M Y H:i\",\"iso\":\"GB\",\"currency_code\":\"GBP\",\"latitude\":\"55.3780510\",\"longitude\":\"-3.4359730\",\"published\":1,\"created_at\":\"2025-05-18T06:36:44.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-06T08:46:12.000000Z\",\"vat\":0,\"continent\":\"europe\"}},\"seated_venue\":null},\"from_date_only\":\"2026-11-21\",\"to_date_only\":\"2026-11-21\",\"from_time_only\":\"07:00 PM\",\"to_time_only\":\"10:00 PM\",\"country_id\":239},{\"id\":5082,\"name\":{\"ar\":\"Performance | Hoda Siahtiri\",\"en\":\"Performance | Hoda Siahtiri\"},\"content\":{\"ar\":\"<p>Join us for an evening that makes space for grief, mourning and collective presence. Self-described as a <em>diseuse</em>, a voicer of stories from different perceptions of time and reality, artist <strong>Hoda Siahtiri </strong>works with voice, embodied memory and ancestral heritage, drawing from lament songs of Bakhtiari women in western Iran. </p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>This event is part of the public programme <em>songs these jaws cannot hold.</em></p>\",\"en\":\"<p>Join us for an evening that makes space for grief, mourning and collective presence. Self-described as a <em>diseuse</em>, a voicer of stories from different perceptions of time and reality, artist <strong>Hoda Siahtiri </strong>works with voice, embodied memory and ancestral heritage, drawing from lament songs of Bakhtiari women in western Iran. </p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>This event is part of the public programme <em>songs these jaws cannot hold.</em></p>\"},\"image\":\"images/SLjyIdMsujpXPMMWRYGmGB8DIWdgOU2I8WcJUkI5.jpg\",\"images\":{\"banner_default_image\":\"false\"},\"place\":{\"ar\":\"Mosaic Rooms\",\"en\":\"Mosaic Rooms\"},\"place_id\":727,\"city_id\":14885,\"slug\":\"performance-hoda-siahtiri\",\"from_date\":\"2026-11-25 17:00\",\"to_date\":\"2026-11-25 19:00\",\"ticket_types\":[],\"category_id\":2,\"user_id\":59377,\"published\":1,\"private\":null,\"created_at\":\"2026-10-28T15:06:31.000000Z\",\"gateway\":\"Stripe_eu\",\"seatsIo\":[],\"rsvp\":1,\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"starting_from\":[],\"cta_label\":null,\"city_name\":{\"ar\":\"لندن\",\"en\":\"London\"},\"unlisted\":0,\"extra_detail\":{\"type\":\"rsvp\",\"agenda\":{\"ar\":\"\",\"en\":\"\"},\"language\":\"english\",\"is_reviewed\":\"1\",\"good_to_know\":{\"ar\":\"\",\"en\":\"\"},\"hubspot_deal_id\":\"359665835766\",\"is_pending_review\":\"0\",\"is_already_selling\":\"0\",\"agree_terms_and_conditions\":true,\"already_submitted_for_review\":true,\"duplicate_good_to_know_payment\":false,\"terms_and_conditions_timestamp\":\"2026-10-28T15:07:14.982570Z\"},\"feature_private\":0,\"seo\":null,\"is_past\":0,\"label\":\"Performance | Hoda Siahtiri\",\"start_date\":\"Wed, Nov 25, 2026 7:00 PM\",\"lowest_price\":null,\"current_step\":\"rsvp\",\"event_type\":\"rsvp\",\"event_step_status\":{\"event-details\":true,\"event-media\":true,\"pre-approval-tickets\":false,\"pre-approval-fields\":false,\"general-tickets\":false,\"seating-event\":false,\"seating-event-pre-approval\":false,\"rsvp\":false,\"event-preview\":false},\"venue_thumbnail_url\":null,\"checkout_link\":\"https://tzkrti.com/checkout/5082?page=1&city=london&country=gb&category=events\",\"sale_status\":\"On Sale\",\"fees\":{\"refund\":{\"type\":\"percentage\",\"value\":\"5\",\"source\":\"environment\"},\"ticket\":{\"buyer\":null,\"organizer\":{\"type\":\"percentage\",\"value\":\"7\",\"source\":\"user\"},\"shared\":false}},\"category\":{\"id\":2,\"name\":{\"ar\":\"فن\",\"en\":\"Art\"},\"parent_id\":32,\"slug\":\"art\",\"label\":\"Art\"},\"place_obj\":{\"id\":727,\"city_id\":14885,\"seated_venue_id\":null,\"label\":\"Mosaic Rooms | Mosaic Rooms\",\"slug\":\"mosaic-rooms-mosaic-rooms\",\"name\":{\"ar\":\"Mosaic Rooms\",\"en\":\"Mosaic Rooms\"},\"description\":{\"ar\":\"\",\"en\":\"\"},\"content\":{\"ar\":\"\",\"en\":\"\"},\"social_links\":null,\"latitude\":\"51.4949507\",\"longitude\":\"-0.1952534\",\"address\":\"226 Cromwell Rd, London SW5 0SW, UK\",\"icon\":null,\"image\":null,\"published\":1,\"created_at\":\"2026-06-16T21:19:48.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-06-16T21:19:48.000000Z\",\"user_id\":59377,\"city\":{\"id\":14885,\"name\":{\"ar\":\"لندن\",\"en\":\"London\"},\"slug\":\"london\",\"timezone\":null,\"latitude\":\"51.5072° N\",\"longitude\":\"0.1276° W\",\"published\":1,\"is_capital\":0,\"country_id\":239,\"currency_code\":\"GBP\",\"created_at\":\"2025-05-18T06:37:06.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-06T08:46:12.000000Z\",\"unlisted\":0,\"country\":{\"id\":239,\"name\":{\"ar\":\"المملكة المتحدة\",\"en\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"date_format\":\"D, d M Y H:i\",\"iso\":\"GB\",\"currency_code\":\"GBP\",\"latitude\":\"55.3780510\",\"longitude\":\"-3.4359730\",\"published\":1,\"created_at\":\"2025-05-18T06:36:44.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-06T08:46:12.000000Z\",\"vat\":0,\"continent\":\"europe\"}},\"seated_venue\":null},\"from_date_only\":\"2026-11-25\",\"to_date_only\":\"2026-11-25\",\"from_time_only\":\"07:00 PM\",\"to_time_only\":\"09:00 PM\",\"country_id\":239},{\"id\":4888,\"name\":{\"ar\":\"Nafs - day rave series\",\"en\":\"Nafs - day rave series\"},\"content\":{\"ar\":\"<p>Space, Body &amp; Power 📿</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>Sunday 29 November</p><p>3–11pm | The Living Womb</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>Nafs day rave 001 lineup.&nbsp;</p><p>The rest happens in the room.</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>Performances by:</p><p>★ Zutana Hadaddeen</p><p>★ Younes Guilmot</p><p>★ Rahim El Habachi</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>DJ sets by:</p><p>★ Loris</p><p>★ Data Theif</p><p>★ Amr</p><p>★ Veil B2B ????</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>Art installation by Kasra Jalilpour.</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>Hosted by our brilliant hosts, Adam Ali &amp; Rukan Ackani.&nbsp;</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>When you need a softer pace, our chill zone brings contemporary بيت الشعر vibes. A space to settle into, talk, and take a breath between dances.&nbsp;</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>An afternoon into evening of music, performance, art, and a few things we’re keeping to ourselves. What makes the day won’t all make it onto your feed. You’ll have to be there. 📿</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>Our space, our shared commitments:</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>★ Mutual respect is non-negotiable. Respect each other’s boundaries, identities and personal space. No racism, sexism, homophobia, transphobia, harassment or discrimination. If you experience or witness harm, speak to our team.</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>★ We stand for trans rights, queer liberation and the safety of marginalised communities. We acknowledge the ongoing oppression of people of colour and respect the lived experiences that shape this space.</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>★ We reject genocide, authoritarianism, occupation and systems that uphold oppression. This space is for community, expression and collective care.</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>★ No personal photography or filming. Only our authorised media team may photograph or film, and only guests wearing wristbands consent to being photographed. Wristbands are optional. No wristband means no photos or filming.</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>★ No guest list. A ticket does not guarantee entry. Admission is at the discretion of our door staff.</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>★ Nafs comes from a longing to feel more at ease around each other as queer SWANA+ people. To meet without having to explain every part of ourselves, and to find connection at our own pace. Whether you arrive with friends or on your own, there’s room for you here. No pressure to perform belonging. Just space to be.</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>★ This rave is self-funded and helps keep NAFS going. Your ticket makes it possible and supports what comes next. If the price is out of reach, message us privately for discounted tickets. We don’t want money to keep you from the dancefloor.</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>Look after each other.&nbsp;</p><p>See you in the room. 📿</p>\",\"en\":\"<p>Space, Body &amp; Power 📿</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>Sunday 29 November</p><p>3–11pm | The Living Womb</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>Nafs day rave 001 lineup.&nbsp;</p><p>The rest happens in the room.</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>Performances by:</p><p>★ Zutana Hadaddeen</p><p>★ Younes Guilmot</p><p>★ Rahim El Habachi</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>DJ sets by:</p><p>★ Loris</p><p>★ Data Theif</p><p>★ Amr</p><p>★ Veil B2B ????</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>Art installation by Kasra Jalilpour.</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>Hosted by our brilliant hosts, Adam Ali &amp; Rukan Ackani.&nbsp;</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>When you need a softer pace, our chill zone brings contemporary بيت الشعر vibes. A space to settle into, talk, and take a breath between dances.&nbsp;</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>An afternoon into evening of music, performance, art, and a few things we’re keeping to ourselves. What makes the day won’t all make it onto your feed. You’ll have to be there. 📿</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>Our space, our shared commitments:</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>★ Mutual respect is non-negotiable. Respect each other’s boundaries, identities and personal space. No racism, sexism, homophobia, transphobia, harassment or discrimination. If you experience or witness harm, speak to our team.</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>★ We stand for trans rights, queer liberation and the safety of marginalised communities. We acknowledge the ongoing oppression of people of colour and respect the lived experiences that shape this space.</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>★ We reject genocide, authoritarianism, occupation and systems that uphold oppression. This space is for community, expression and collective care.</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>★ No personal photography or filming. Only our authorised media team may photograph or film, and only guests wearing wristbands consent to being photographed. Wristbands are optional. No wristband means no photos or filming.</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>★ No guest list. A ticket does not guarantee entry. Admission is at the discretion of our door staff.</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>★ Nafs comes from a longing to feel more at ease around each other as queer SWANA+ people. To meet without having to explain every part of ourselves, and to find connection at our own pace. Whether you arrive with friends or on your own, there’s room for you here. No pressure to perform belonging. Just space to be.</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>★ This rave is self-funded and helps keep NAFS going. Your ticket makes it possible and supports what comes next. If the price is out of reach, message us privately for discounted tickets. We don’t want money to keep you from the dancefloor.</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>Look after each other.&nbsp;</p><p>See you in the room. 📿</p>\"},\"image\":\"images/gMb8PDiNBxyE3F6R0NRljzBE0CMIyXhJOY7myUSz.png\",\"images\":{\"banner_default_image\":\"false\"},\"place\":{\"ar\":\"The living womb\",\"en\":\"The living womb\"},\"place_id\":982,\"city_id\":14885,\"slug\":\"nafs-day-rave-series\",\"from_date\":\"2026-11-29 13:00\",\"to_date\":\"2026-11-29 21:00\",\"ticket_types\":[{\"fees\":0,\"name\":\"EarlyBird_0\",\"color\":null,\"index\":0,\"price\":\"15\",\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"due_date\":null,\"fees_vat\":0,\"label_ar\":\"Early Bird\",\"label_en\":\"Early Bird\",\"pay_free\":false,\"quantity\":\"20\",\"description\":null,\"hide_ticket\":false,\"pay_as_need\":true,\"max_quantity\":\"3\",\"min_quantity\":\"1\",\"sell_to_time\":null,\"fees_vat_rate\":0,\"sell_end_date\":null,\"ticket_active\":false,\"description_ar\":\"\",\"description_en\":\"\",\"sell_from_date\":null,\"sell_from_time\":null,\"disable_selling\":false,\"exchange_prices\":{\"AED\":73.4,\"AUD\":28.4,\"EUR\":17.8,\"GBP\":15,\"ILS\":62.8,\"JOD\":14.2,\"TRY\":999.4,\"USD\":20},\"fees_before_vat\":0,\"sell_start_date\":null,\"ticket_type_name\":4,\"pay_as_need_config\":{\"max\":null,\"step\":null},\"ticket_type_name_other\":\"\"},{\"fees\":0,\"name\":\"1strelease_1\",\"color\":null,\"index\":1,\"price\":\"