137.01,\"AUD\":53.01,\"EUR\":33.23,\"GBP\":28,\"ILS\":117.23,\"JOD\":26.51,\"TRY\":1865.55,\"USD\":37.33},\"fees_before_vat\":0,\"sell_start_date\":null,\"ticket_type_name\":\"other\",\"pay_as_need_config\":{\"max\":null,\"step\":null},\"ticket_type_name_other\":\"\"}],\"category_id\":1,\"user_id\":103883,\"published\":1,\"private\":0,\"created_at\":\"2026-10-21T13:36:29.000000Z\",\"gateway\":\"Stripe_eu\",\"seatsIo\":[],\"rsvp\":0,\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"starting_from\":{\"AED\":88.08,\"AUD\":34.08,\"EUR\":21.36,\"GBP\":18,\"ILS\":75.36,\"JOD\":17.04,\"TRY\":1199.28,\"USD\":24},\"cta_label\":{\"ar\":\"\",\"en\":\"\",\"external_link\":\"\"},\"city_name\":{\"ar\":\"لندن\",\"en\":\"London\"},\"unlisted\":0,\"extra_detail\":{\"type\":\"regular\",\"agenda\":{\"ar\":\"<p>We’ve brought together some of the most exciting queer Arab artists from London, Berlin and Barcelona</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p><strong>Performance </strong></p><p><strong>Salma Zahore</strong> </p><p>Iconic Lebanese drag artist who has performed from Barcelona to Paris to Amsterdam. Unapologetically Arab.</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p><strong>Tarek Khwiss</strong> </p><p>Legendary dancer and choreographer bringing some heat. </p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p><strong>Music </strong></p><p><strong>Seksu</strong> </p><p>London-based Algerian DJ and founder of Bledi. Iconic club tracks blended with anthems from across the Arab world and North Africa.</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p><strong>Ashtattz</strong></p><p>Cairo-born, Barcelona-based DJ and the force behind Takhnis. Arab rhythms meet house, electro and club sounds.</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p><strong>Tareq </strong></p><p>One half of Boys’ Shorts. You’ve seen him at Feel It, DILF and Horse Meat Disco. House, techno and disco.</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p><strong>DJ Aboalaa</strong></p><p>The hottest Arabic DJ in Berlin, bringing 90s and 00s Arabic dance pop. The mystery guest of the night.</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p><strong>3MR</strong> </p><p> Co-founder of Drip and Erotica club, taking you home sweaty with everything from Haifa to hard techno.</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p><strong>Host</strong></p><p><strong>Hasan</strong> <strong>Kilani</strong></p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p><strong>Produced by</strong></p><p><strong>@its_3mr_okay × @omarighazal</strong></p>\",\"en\":\"<p>We’ve brought together some of the most exciting queer Arab artists from London, Berlin and Barcelona</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p><strong>Performance </strong></p><p><strong>Salma Zahore</strong> </p><p>Iconic Lebanese drag artist who has performed from Barcelona to Paris to Amsterdam. Unapologetically Arab.</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p><strong>Tarek Khwiss</strong> </p><p>Legendary dancer and choreographer bringing some heat. </p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p><strong>Music </strong></p><p><strong>Seksu</strong> </p><p>London-based Algerian DJ and founder of Bledi. Iconic club tracks blended with anthems from across the Arab world and North Africa.</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p><strong>Ashtattz</strong></p><p>Cairo-born, Barcelona-based DJ and the force behind Takhnis. Arab rhythms meet house, electro and club sounds.</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p><strong>Tareq </strong></p><p>One half of Boys’ Shorts. You’ve seen him at Feel It, DILF and Horse Meat Disco. House, techno and disco.</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p><strong>DJ Aboalaa</strong></p><p>The hottest Arabic DJ in Berlin, bringing 90s and 00s Arabic dance pop. The mystery guest of the night.</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p><strong>3MR</strong> </p><p> Co-founder of Drip and Erotica club, taking you home sweaty with everything from Haifa to hard techno.</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p><strong>Host</strong></p><p><strong>Hasan</strong> <strong>Kilani</strong></p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p><strong>Produced by</strong></p><p><strong>@its_3mr_okay × @omarighazal</strong></p>\"},\"language\":\"english\",\"is_reviewed\":\"1\",\"good_to_know\":{\"ar\":\"<p>18+ event</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>Valid photo ID required. No ID, no entry</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>Phone cameras will be covered with stickers</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>No smart glasses</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>Our photographer will capture the artists only, not the crowd</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>The room is reached by stairs, with no step-free access</p>\",\"en\":\"<p>18+ event</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>Valid photo ID required. No ID, no entry</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>Phone cameras will be covered with stickers</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>No smart glasses</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>Our photographer will capture the artists only, not the crowd</p><p style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\" style=\\\"height: 22px;\\\"></p><p>The room is reached by stairs, with no step-free access</p>\"},\"multiple_dates\":false,\"hubspot_deal_id\":\"358151939810\",\"is_pending_review\":\"0\",\"is_already_selling\":\"1\",\"agree_terms_and_conditions\":true,\"alre